WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:22.689
(ANNOUNCER 1)
Pigskins take on conference rival Armadillo High this Friday

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.482
In the first round of the playoffs

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.860
You know Coach Walker's got those boys

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.280
practicing hard to make sure they're ready for war

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:36.036
You think that'll get us on House of Highlights?

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.121
No. But this will

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:39.539
Go!

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:44.794
Wooooo!

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.795
Yeah, man!

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.088
You're ready for-

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:48.256
What the hell y'all doing?!

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.050
This ain't no circus show.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.384
This is football. 

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.721
Two hands. Always use two hands!

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.722
Why are you here?

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.890
Practice ended an hour ago 

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.808
And this is MY house!

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.353
Why is this town always watching us practice

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:05.732
It's 6 p.m. on a Tuesday!

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:07.650
Don't you have families?

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:12.363
FOOTBALL! FOOTBALL! FOOTBALL!

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:18.536
Sixty-one hours until the big game against

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:21.289
The Armadillo High Armadillos! 

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:23.458
It's like Chrismas Eve!

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:24.542
Except more religious

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:26.544
Hey, you guys stressed about that bio test tomorrow?

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:28.880
Yeah, I'm hitting up the library after practice

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.965
Who needs my help?!

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:33.510
Are you someone's mom or...?

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:35.178
Not yet, QB.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.930
Not yet

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:40.058
Who needs to be adopted?!

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:43.770
None of us

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.774
I'm ready to open my home

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:49.400
And my heart

00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:51.111
She's doing that thing from The Blind Side

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.278
Come with me!

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.030
No

00:01:54.322 --> 00:01:55.615
You are a stranger

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:59.577
And adoption is a long legal process

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:00.870
With lots of paperwork

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:05.667
Well, it looks like you can teach me

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.878
just as much as I can teach you

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:10.964
Boys?

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:12.674
Bring it in

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.093
I think I've seen this lady at the gas station

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:18.638
We may be from different worlds

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:27.063
But we're all still human

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.736
What is wrong with this town?

00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:35.530
Boys?

00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:38.116
I...I can inspire you!

